{
  "_about": "What zctl prints for the commands the SDK runs, and each refusal it tells apart (pkg/zctl TestZctlPrintsWhatTheSDKReads; -update rewrites it). sdk/python/tests/test_zctl_wire.py holds the SDK to taking each refusal for what it means, and to reading only the keys of each output.",
