      "code": 67,
      "stderr": "zctl: this context logs in with the SDK (zenthros.login()), which zctl does not do: set ZENTHROS_TOKEN or ZENTHROS_TOKEN_FILE, use a token-command, or switch with `zctl config use-context NAME` or ZENTHROS_CONTEXT=NAME\n"
    },
    {
      "case": "Kubernetes refused the key",
      "means": "login",
      "args": [
        "get",
        "zenthrosjob",
        "-o",
        "json",
        "train"
      ],
      "code": 67,
      "stderr": "zctl: get zenthrosjob: Unauthorized\n"
    },
    {
      "case": "Kubernetes forbids the key the job",
